{"ticker":"HRL","updated":"2026-11-20T22:59:22Z","profile":{"longName":"Hormel Foods Corporation","shortName":"Hormel Foods Corporation","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","country":"United States","website":"https://www.hormelfoods.com","fullTimeEmployees":20000,"marketCap":12955257856,"trailingPE":37.967743,"forwardPE":15.036346,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.0665475,"pegRatio":1.59,"targetMeanPrice":24.9375,"targetHighPrice":28.0,"targetLowPrice":23.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":8,"recommendationKey":"none","revenueGrowth":-0.024,"earningsGrowth":-0.672,"grossMargins":0.15741,"operatingMargins":0.08177,"profitMargins":0.028210001,"totalRevenue":12146911232,"beta":0.262,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":26.6,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":18.96,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":5.07},"summary":"Hormel Foods Corporation develops, processes, and distributes various meat, nut, and other food products to foodservice, convenience stores, and commercial customers in the United States and internationally. It operates through three segments: Retail, Foodservice, and International. The company provides perishable products, including fresh meats, frozen items, refrigerated meal solutions, bacon, sausages, hams, guacamole, and other items that require refrigeration, as well as shelf-stable products, such as canned luncheon meats, nut butters, snack nuts, chili, shelf-stable microwaveable meals, hash, stews, tortillas, salsas, tortilla chips, and other items that do not require refrigeration. It sells its products under the HORMEL, ALWAYS TENDER, APPLEGATE, AUSTIN BLUES, BACON 1, BLACK LABEL, BREAD READY, BURKE, CAFÉ H, CERATTI, CHI-CHI'S, COLUMBUS, COMPLEATS, CORN NUTS, CURE 81, DAN'S PRIZE, DI LUSSO, DINTY MOORE, DON MIGUEL, DOÑA MARIA, EMBASA, FAST N EASY, FIRE BRAISED, FONTANINI, HERDEZ, HORMEL GATHERINGS, HOUSE OF TSANG, JENNIE-O, JUSTIN'S, LA VICTORIA, LAYOUT, LLOYD'S, MARY KITCHEN, MR. PEANUT, NATURAL CHOICE, NUT-RITION, OLD SMOKEHOUSE, OVEN READY, PILLOW PACK, PLANTERS, ROSA GRANDE, SADLER'S SMOKEHOUSE, SKIPPY, SPAM, SQUARE TABLE, SPECIAL RECIPE, VALLEY FRESH, and WHOLLY brands through sales personnel, independent brokers, and distributors. The company was formerly known","summary_zh":"荷美爾食品公司為美國和國際上的餐飲服務、便利商店和商業客戶開發、加工和分銷各種肉類、堅果和其他食品。它透過三個部門運作：零售、餐飲服務和國際。該公司提供易腐爛的產品，包括新鮮肉類、冷凍食品、冷藏膳食解決方案、培根、香腸、火腿、酪梨醬和其他需要冷藏的食品，以及耐儲存的產品，例如罐裝午餐肉、堅果醬、零食堅果、辣椒、耐儲存的微波食品、哈希、燉菜、玉米餅、莎莎醬、玉米片和其他不需要冷藏的食品。它以 HORMEL、ALWAYS TENDER、APPLEGATE、AUSTIN BLUES、BACON 1、BLACK LABEL、BREAD READY、BURKE、CAFÉ H、CERATTI、CHI-CHI'S、COLUMBUS、COMPLEATS、CORN NUTS、CURE 81、DANS COLUMBUS、COMPLEATS、CORN NUTS、CURE 81、DAN） MARIA、EMBASA、FAST N EASY、FIRE BRAISED、FONTANINI、HERDEZ、HORMEL GATHERINGS、HOUSE OF TSANG、JENNIE-O、JUSTIN'S、LA VICTORIA、LAYOUT、LLOYD'S、MARY KITCHEN、MR. PEUT、ICTORIA、LAYOUT、LLOYD'S、MARY KITCHEN、MR. PE UT、 READY、PILLOW PACK、PLANTERS、ROSA GRANDE、SADLER'S SMOKEHOUSE、SKIPPY、SPAM、SQUARE TABLE、SPECIAL RECIPE、VALLEY FRESH 和 WHOLLY 品牌透過銷售人員、獨立經紀人和經銷商提供。該公司前身為","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"包裝食品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":24.81,"h":24.81,"l":24.31,"c":24.31,"v":5239900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":24.38,"h":24.54,"l":24.27,"c":24.44,"v":4131900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":24.39,"h":24.75,"l":24.38,"c":24.71,"v":3666500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":24.86,"h":24.86,"l":24.33,"c":24.41,"v":2907200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":24.48,"h":24.73,"l":24.45,"c":24.72,"v":2715600},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":24.85,"h":24.85,"l":24.43,"c":24.64,"v":4608900},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":24.71,"h":24.83,"l":24.51,"c":24.74,"v":3466000},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":24.84,"h":24.93,"l":24.53,"c":24.8,"v":3017800},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":24.69,"h":24.85,"l":24.62,"c":24.66,"v":3243900},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":24.68,"h":24.79,"l":24.58,"c":24.64,"v":2839000},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":24.6,"h":24.67,"l":24.3,"c":24.31,"v":4183000},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":24.38,"h":24.38,"l":23.89,"c":24.0,"v":8872800},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":24.01,"h":24.01,"l":23.8,"c":23.89,"v":3330000},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":23.92,"h":24